      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "坐标。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "507",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "方程 $x-y^2=16$ 的图象上一点的纵坐标是 $-1.3$。求这",
        "点的横坐标。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "508",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "任意写出三个方程，使它们的图象都经过点 $(-2,4)$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "509",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "适当选择方程 $y=ax^2-4$ 的系数 $a$，使它的图象经过点",
        "$P(1,-3)$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "510",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "不作图，证明：方程 $xy=12$，$2x+y=10$，$4x^2+y^2=52$",
        "的图象都经过点 $A(3,4)$ 和 $B(2,6)$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "第 24 小节"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "511",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "下列方程中，哪几个给出函数 $x\\xrightarrow{f}y$？",
        "а) $1.7x+3y=0$；　　б) $5x-0y=4$；",
        "в) $x-0.6y=1.5$；　　г) $0x+4y=1.6$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "512",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "适当选择方程 $ax+by=6$ 的系数 $a$ 和 $b$，使方程给出的",
        "关系",
        "а) 是函数 $x\\xrightarrow{f}y$；",
        "б) 不是函数 $x\\xrightarrow{f}y$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "513",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "用作图的方法证明：直线 $y=-x+5$，$2x-y=16$，",
        "$x+2y-3=0$ 相交于一点。写出这点的坐标。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "514",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在同一坐标系中作出直线 $y-2x=0$ 和 $x+y=6$ 的图",
        "象，写出交点的坐标。不作图，确定方程 $2x^3-xy=8$ 的",
        "图象是否经过直线的交点。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "515",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "作下列方程的图象：",
        "а) $x+y=6$；　　б) $x-y=0$；",
        "в) $2x+0y=10$；　　г) $0x+5y=-10$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "516",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "适当选择方程 $ax-y=4$ 的系数 $a$，使它的图象经过点"
      ]
    },
